{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  MAIN PRODUCT — página de produto (Mater, foco em conversão)
  ============================================================

  O QUE FAZ:
  Página completa do produto: galeria com miniaturas (arrasta no
  celular), seleção de COR e TAMANHO, provador virtual, estoque
  baixo, botões Adicionar ao carrinho / Comprar agora, selos de
  confiança, descrição e políticas em sanfona, e uma barra fixa de
  compra que aparece quando os botões principais saem da tela.

  ONDE É USADA:
  templates/product.json, como section principal.

  PRINCIPAIS PARTES:
  - Galeria (.product__gallery): trilho horizontal com scroll-snap
    (#ProductMedia-{id}) + miniaturas. Ao trocar a COR, o JS rola
    o trilho até a foto da variante (variant.featured_media).
  - Blocks (editor de temas), na ordem do template:
    vendor, title, price, variant_picker, provador, quantity,
    buy_buttons, trust, description, share, custom_liquid e @app.
  - variant_picker: opções de COR viram bolinhas (swatch do Shopify,
    ou o de/para por nome abaixo, ou a foto da variante); TAMANHO e
    demais opções viram botões. A legenda mostra o valor escolhido
    ("Cor: Preto"). Tamanhos esgotados para a cor escolhida ficam
    riscados.
  - provador: "Provador virtual" — o cliente informa altura, peso e
    caimento preferido; o JS cruza com a TABELA do setting size_rules
    e recomenda (e seleciona) o tamanho. É um recomendador por
    medidas, sem app e sem foto.
  - buy_buttons: "Adicionar ao carrinho" (AJAX via assets/carrinho.js)
    e "Comprar agora" (name=return_to value=/checkout — o Shopify
    adiciona e vai direto ao checkout; o carrinho.js ignora esse
    botão por causa do data-buy-now).
  - Estoque baixo: "Últimas N unidades" quando o Shopify controla o
    estoque da variante e sobram até low_stock_threshold.
  - [data-variant-json]: dados das variantes para o JS
    (snippets/product-variant-selection.liquid).
  - Estilos em snippets/product-media-gallery.liquid.

  CONFIRME NA SUA LOJA:
  Parcelamento, desconto no Pix, textos de confiança e a tabela do
  provador são configuráveis e precisam refletir a realidade da loja.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product_form_id = 'product-form-' | append: section.id
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant

  assign swatch_names = 'preto,branco,bege,cinza,azul,verde,vermelho,amarelo,rosa,roxo,laranja,marrom,off white,creme,off-white,areia,caqui,chumbo,grafite,marinho,azul marinho,verde militar,vinho,black,white,gray,grey,navy,sand' | split: ','
  assign swatch_hexes = '#070707,#ffffff,#d9c9a8,#9a9a97,#1c4ed8,#15803d,#b91c1c,#eab308,#ec4899,#7c3aed,#ea580c,#78350f,#f3efe7,#efe6d2,#f3efe7,#d8c7a5,#b8a67e,#4b4b4b,#3a3a3a,#1e2a4a,#1e2a4a,#4b5320,#6b1d2a,#070707,#ffffff,#9a9a97,#9a9a97,#1e2a4a,#d8c7a5' | split: ','

  assign low_stock_threshold = 5
  assign has_size_option = false
  for option in product.options_with_values
    assign opt_key = option.name | downcase
    if opt_key contains 'tamanho' or opt_key contains 'size'
      assign has_size_option = true
    endif
  endfor
-%}

<section class="product" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  <nav class="product__breadcrumb" aria-label="{{ 'general.breadcrumbs.home' | t }}">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{{ 'general.breadcrumbs.home' | t }}</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
    {%- if collection.title != blank -%}
      <a href="{{ collection.url }}">{{ collection.title | escape }}</a>
    {%- else -%}
      <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
        {%- if product.type != blank -%}
          {{- product.type -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- 'general.breadcrumbs.products' | t -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
    <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
    <span aria-current="page">{{ product.title | escape }}</span>
  </nav>

  {%- comment -%} ---------------- GALERIA ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="product__gallery">
    {%- if product.media.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="product__stage">
        <div class="product__track" id="ProductMedia-{{ section.id }}" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}">
          {%- for media in product.media -%}
            <div
              class="product__media-item"
              data-media-id="{{ media.id }}"
              data-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
            >
              {%- case media.media_type -%}
                {%- when 'image' -%}
                  {%- if forloop.first -%}
                    {%- assign media_loading = 'eager' -%}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- assign media_loading = 'lazy' -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {{
                    media
                    | image_url: width: 1800
                    | image_tag:
                      loading: media_loading,
                      sizes: '(min-width: 1000px) 55vw, 100vw',
                      widths: '360, 540, 720, 900, 1080, 1440, 1800',
                      alt: media.alt | default: product.title | escape
                  }}
                {%- when 'external_video' -%}
                  {{ media | external_video_tag }}
                {%- when 'video' -%}
                  {{ media | video_tag: controls: true, image_size: '1800x' }}
                {%- when 'model' -%}
                  {{ media | model_viewer_tag }}
                {%- else -%}
                  {{ media | media_tag }}
              {%- endcase -%}
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%}
          <button type="button" class="product__nav product__nav--prev" data-gallery-prev aria-label="Foto anterior">
            {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="product__nav product__nav--next" data-gallery-next aria-label="Próxima foto">
            {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}
          </button>
          <span class="product__counter" aria-hidden="true"><span data-gallery-current>1</span> / {{ product.media.size }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
          {%- assign off = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price -%}
          <span class="product__flag">-{{ off }}%</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%}
        <div class="product__thumbs" role="list">
          {%- for media in product.media -%}
            <button
              type="button"
              class="product__thumb{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}"
              data-thumb-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
              aria-label="Ver foto {{ forloop.index }}"
              role="listitem"
            >
              {{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 180 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="product__stage">
        <div class="product__media-item product__media-placeholder">
          {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------------- COMPRA ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="product__info">
    {%- form 'product',
      product,
      id: product_form_id,
      class: 'product__form',
      novalidate: 'novalidate',
      data-type: 'add-to-cart-form'
    -%}
      <input
        type="hidden"
        name="id"
        value="{{ current_variant.id }}"
        {% if current_variant.available == false %}disabled{% endif %}
        class="product-variant-id"
      >

      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- case block.type -%}
          {%- when '@app' -%}
            {% render block %}

          {%- when 'vendor' -%}
            {%- if product.vendor != blank and product.vendor != shop.name -%}
              <p class="product__vendor" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ product.vendor }}</p>
            {%- elsif product.type != blank -%}
              <p class="product__vendor" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ product.type }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}

          {%- when 'title' -%}
            <h1 class="product__title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>

          {%- when 'price' -%}
            <div
              class="product__price"
              data-installments="{{ block.settings.installments }}"
              data-pix="{{ block.settings.pix_discount }}"
              {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
            >
              {% render 'price', product: product, use_variant: true, show_compare: true %}

              {%- if block.settings.installments > 1 -%}
                {%- assign installment_value = current_variant.price | divided_by: block.settings.installments -%}
                <p class="product__installments" data-installments-text>
                  ou <strong>{{ block.settings.installments }}x de {{ installment_value | money }}</strong>
                  {%- if block.settings.interest_free %} sem juros{% endif -%}
                </p>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if block.settings.pix_discount > 0 -%}
                {%- assign pix_factor = 100 | minus: block.settings.pix_discount -%}
                {%- assign pix_price = current_variant.price | times: pix_factor | divided_by: 100 -%}
                <p class="product__pix" data-pix-text>
                  <span class="product__pix-tag">PIX</span>
                  <strong>{{ pix_price | money }}</strong> à vista ({{ block.settings.pix_discount }}% off)
                </p>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if current_variant.unit_price_measurement -%}
                <div class="product__unit-price">
                  {{ current_variant.unit_price | money }}
                  <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
                  {%- if current_variant.unit_price_measurement.reference_value != 1 -%}
                    {{ current_variant.unit_price_measurement.reference_value }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {{ current_variant.unit_price_measurement.reference_unit }}
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

          {%- when 'variant_picker' -%}
            {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%}
              <div class="product__variants" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign opt_key = option.name | downcase
                    assign is_color = false
                    assign is_size = false
                    if opt_key contains 'cor' or opt_key contains 'color' or opt_key contains 'colour'
                      assign is_color = true
                    elsif opt_key contains 'tamanho' or opt_key contains 'size'
                      assign is_size = true
                    endif
                    assign option_index = forloop.index0
                  -%}
                  <fieldset
                    class="product__option{% if is_color %} product__option--color{% endif %}{% if is_size %} product__option--size{% endif %}"
                    data-option-index="{{ option_index }}"
                  >
                    <div class="product__option-head">
                      <legend class="product__option-name">
                        {{ option.name | escape }}:
                        <span class="product__option-value" data-selected-value>{{ option.selected_value | escape }}</span>
                      </legend>
                      {%- if is_size and section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
                        {%- for b in section.blocks -%}
                          {%- if b.type == 'provador' -%}
                            <button type="button" class="product__guide-link" data-provador-open>
                              Qual é meu tamanho?
                            </button>
                            {%- break -%}
                          {%- endif -%}
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </div>

                    <div class="product__option-values">
                      {%- for value in option.values -%}
                        {%- liquid
                          assign option_disabled = true
                          assign value_media = nil
                          for variant in product.variants
                            if variant.options[option_index] == value
                              if value_media == nil and variant.featured_media
                                assign value_media = variant.featured_media
                              endif
                              if variant.available
                                assign option_disabled = false
                              endif
                            endif
                          endfor

                          assign swatch_hex = nil
                          if is_color
                            assign value_key = value | downcase | strip
                            for name in swatch_names
                              if name == value_key
                                assign swatch_hex = swatch_hexes[forloop.index0]
                                break
                              endif
                            endfor
                          endif
                        -%}
                        <label
                          class="product__swatch{% if is_color %} product__swatch--color{% endif %}{% if option.selected_value == value %} is-selected{% endif %}{% if option_disabled %} is-unavailable{% endif %}"
                          title="{{ value | escape }}"
                        >
                          <input
                            type="radio"
                            name="{{ option.name | escape }}"
                            value="{{ value | escape }}"
                            class="visually-hidden"
                            {% if option.selected_value == value %}checked{% endif %}
                            data-option-index="{{ option_index }}"
                          >
                          {%- if is_color -%}
                            {%- if value.swatch.color -%}
                              <span class="product__swatch-color" style="background-color: {{ value.swatch.color }};"></span>
                            {%- elsif value.swatch.image -%}
                              <span class="product__swatch-color" style="background-image: url({{ value.swatch.image | image_url: width: 100 }});"></span>
                            {%- elsif swatch_hex -%}
                              <span class="product__swatch-color" style="background-color: {{ swatch_hex }};"></span>
                            {%- elsif value_media -%}
                              <span class="product__swatch-color" style="background-image: url({{ value_media.preview_image | image_url: width: 100 }});"></span>
                            {%- else -%}
                              <span class="product__swatch-label">{{ value | escape }}</span>
                            {%- endif -%}
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ value | escape }}</span>
                          {%- else -%}
                            <span class="product__swatch-label">{{ value | escape }}</span>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </label>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </div>
                  </fieldset>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            {%- endunless -%}

            <script type="application/json" data-variant-json>
              [
                {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign stock = nil
                    if variant.inventory_management == 'shopify' and variant.inventory_policy == 'deny'
                      assign stock = variant.inventory_quantity
                    endif
                  -%}
                  {
                    "id": {{ variant.id | json }},
                    "options": {{ variant.options | json }},
                    "available": {{ variant.available | json }},
                    "price": {{ variant.price | json }},
                    "stock": {{ stock | json }},
                    "featured_media_id": {{ variant.featured_media.id | json }},
                    "price_html": {%- capture variant_price_html -%}{% render 'price', product: variant, use_variant: false, show_compare: true %}{%- endcapture -%}{{ variant_price_html | strip_newlines | json }}
                  }{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              ]
            </script>

          {%- when 'provador' -%}
            {%- if has_size_option -%}
              <button type="button" class="product__provador-card" data-provador-open {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <span class="product__provador-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 3 4 5.5 2.5 10l3 1.2V21h13v-9.8l3-1.2L20 5.5 15 3c-.4 1.5-1.6 2.5-3 2.5S9.4 4.5 9 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="product__provador-text">
                  <strong>{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</strong>
                  <span data-provador-summary>{{ block.settings.subtitle | escape }}</span>
                </span>
                <span class="product__provador-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </button>

              <dialog class="provador" data-provador data-rules="{{ block.settings.size_rules | escape }}" aria-labelledby="ProvadorTitle-{{ section.id }}">
                <div class="provador__box">
                  <button type="button" class="provador__close" data-provador-close aria-label="Fechar">
                    {% render 'icon', name: 'close' %}
                  </button>
                  <p class="provador__eyebrow">// Provador virtual</p>
                  <h2 class="provador__title" id="ProvadorTitle-{{ section.id }}">Descubra seu tamanho</h2>
                  <p class="provador__intro">Informe suas medidas e como você gosta que a camiseta vista. A gente indica o tamanho ideal.</p>

                  <div class="provador__fields">
                    <label class="provador__field">
                      <span>Altura (cm)</span>
                      <input type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="120" max="230" placeholder="175" data-provador-height>
                    </label>
                    <label class="provador__field">
                      <span>Peso (kg)</span>
                      <input type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="30" max="250" placeholder="72" data-provador-weight>
                    </label>
                  </div>

                  <fieldset class="provador__fit">
                    <legend>Caimento preferido</legend>
                    <div class="provador__fit-options">
                      <label><input type="radio" name="provador_fit_{{ section.id }}" value="-1" class="visually-hidden"><span>Mais justa</span></label>
                      <label><input type="radio" name="provador_fit_{{ section.id }}" value="0" class="visually-hidden" checked><span>Regular</span></label>
                      <label><input type="radio" name="provador_fit_{{ section.id }}" value="1" class="visually-hidden"><span>Oversized</span></label>
                    </div>
                  </fieldset>

                  <button type="button" class="provador__submit" data-provador-calc>Ver meu tamanho</button>

                  <div class="provador__result" data-provador-result hidden aria-live="polite">
                    <p class="provador__result-label">Seu tamanho ideal</p>
                    <p class="provador__result-size" data-provador-size></p>
                    <p class="provador__result-note" data-provador-note></p>
                    <button type="button" class="provador__apply" data-provador-apply>Selecionar este tamanho</button>
                  </div>

                  {%- if block.settings.size_chart != blank -%}
                    <details class="provador__chart">
                      <summary>Tabela de medidas {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}</summary>
                      <div class="rte">{{ block.settings.size_chart }}</div>
                    </details>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
              </dialog>
            {%- endif -%}

          {%- when 'quantity' -%}
            <div class="product__quantity" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <label class="field__label" for="Quantity-{{ section.id }}">
                {{ 'products.product.quantity.label' | t }}
              </label>
              <div class="quantity-selector">
                <button type="button" class="quantity__button" name="minus" aria-label="{{ 'products.product.quantity.decrease' | t: product: product.title | escape }}">&minus;</button>
                <input
                  class="quantity__input"
                  type="number"
                  name="quantity"
                  id="Quantity-{{ section.id }}"
                  min="1"
                  value="1"
                  aria-label="{{ 'products.product.quantity.input_label' | t: product: product.title | escape }}"
                >
                <button type="button" class="quantity__button" name="plus" aria-label="{{ 'products.product.quantity.increase' | t: product: product.title | escape }}">&plus;</button>
              </div>
            </div>

          {%- when 'buy_buttons' -%}
            <div class="product__buy" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- liquid
                assign stock = nil
                if current_variant.inventory_management == 'shopify' and current_variant.inventory_policy == 'deny'
                  assign stock = current_variant.inventory_quantity
                endif
              -%}
              <p
                class="product__stock"
                data-stock
                data-threshold="{{ low_stock_threshold }}"
                {% unless stock and stock > 0 and stock <= low_stock_threshold %}hidden{% endunless %}
              >
                <span class="product__stock-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                {%- if stock == 1 -%}
                  <span data-stock-text>Última unidade!</span>
                {%- else -%}
                  <span data-stock-text>Últimas {{ stock }} unidades</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </p>

              <div class="product__buy-buttons" data-buy-buttons>
                <button
                  type="submit"
                  name="add"
                  class="product__btn product__btn--cart product__add-to-cart"
                  {% if current_variant.available == false %}disabled{% endif %}
                >
                  {% render 'icon', name: 'cart' %}
                  <span>
                    {%- if current_variant.available -%}
                      {{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}
                    {%- else -%}
                      {{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </span>
                </button>
                <button
                  type="submit"
                  name="return_to"
                  value="/checkout"
                  class="product__btn product__btn--buy"
                  data-buy-now
                  {% if current_variant.available == false %}disabled{% endif %}
                >
                  {{- 'products.product.buy_now' | t -}}
                </button>
              </div>

              {%- if block.settings.show_dynamic_checkout -%}
                <div class="product__dynamic">{{ form | payment_button }}</div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

          {%- when 'trust' -%}
            <ul class="product__trust" role="list" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- if block.settings.trust_1 != blank -%}
                <li>
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 4 6v6c0 4.5 3.4 8.3 8 9 4.6-.7 8-4.5 8-9V6l-8-3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="m8.5 12 2.5 2.5 4.5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                  <span>{{ block.settings.trust_1 | escape }}</span>
                </li>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.trust_2 != blank -%}
                <li>
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v9H3zM14 10h4l3 3v3h-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="1.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
                  <span>{{ block.settings.trust_2 | escape }}</span>
                </li>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.trust_3 != blank -%}
                <li>
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0 1 14-5.3M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-14 5.3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M18 3v4h-4M6 21v-4h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                  <span>{{ block.settings.trust_3 | escape }}</span>
                </li>
              {%- endif -%}
            </ul>

          {%- when 'description' -%}
            <div class="product__accordions" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- if product.description != blank -%}
                <details class="product__accordion" open>
                  <summary>Descrição {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}</summary>
                  <div class="product__accordion-body rte">{{ product.description }}</div>
                </details>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if shop.shipping_policy.body != blank -%}
                <details class="product__accordion">
                  <summary>Envio e prazo {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}</summary>
                  <div class="product__accordion-body rte">
                    {{ shop.shipping_policy.body | strip_html | truncatewords: 60 }}
                    <p><a href="{{ shop.shipping_policy.url }}">Ver política completa</a></p>
                  </div>
                </details>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if shop.refund_policy.body != blank -%}
                <details class="product__accordion">
                  <summary>Trocas e devoluções {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}</summary>
                  <div class="product__accordion-body rte">
                    {{ shop.refund_policy.body | strip_html | truncatewords: 60 }}
                    <p><a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">Ver política completa</a></p>
                  </div>
                </details>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

          {%- when 'share' -%}
            <div class="product__share" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {% render 'share-button', share_link: product.url, share_title: product.title %}
            </div>

          {%- when 'custom_liquid' -%}
            <div {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ block.settings.custom_liquid }}</div>
        {%- endcase -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endform -%}
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} Barra fixa de compra: aparece quando os botões principais saem da tela. {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="product-sticky" data-product-sticky aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="product-sticky__inner">
    {%- if product.featured_media -%}
      {{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 120 | image_tag: class: 'product-sticky__image', loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="product-sticky__info">
      <p class="product-sticky__title">{{ product.title | escape }}</p>
      <p class="product-sticky__meta">
        <span data-sticky-variant>{% unless product.has_only_default_variant %}{{ current_variant.title | escape }}{% endunless %}</span>
        <strong data-sticky-price>{{ current_variant.price | money }}</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
    <button
      type="submit"
      form="{{ product_form_id }}"
      name="add"
      class="product__btn product__btn--cart product-sticky__button"
      tabindex="-1"
      {% if current_variant.available == false %}disabled{% endif %}
    >
      <span>
        {%- if current_variant.available -%}
          {{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}
        {%- else -%}
          {{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </span>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

{% render 'product-media-gallery', section_id: section.id %}
{% render 'product-variant-selection', section_id: section.id, product_form_id: product_form_id %}

